00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:21.300
building even among some on the left and saying,&nbsp;
okay, even if it's not Pete, Budda Judge's fault,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:27.900
why did he not react or act quickly after it&nbsp;
